	"top_gaps": [
		"Domain-event outbox written by enqueueOutboxEvent (apps/api/src/events/outbox.ts) has no consumer; the registered outbox-drain job (apps/api/src/scheduler/outbox-drain.ts -> notification/outbox-drain.ts) delivers notification-delivery rows only, so sla.at_risk/breached, submission.replied and outbox work_item.transitioned never reach notifications/webhooks/escalation (SLA-16, IQ-12, WF-20)",
		"SLA escalation along project stakeholder order is unimplemented; project escalationOrder fields exist but nothing consumes them (SLA-17). Engagement coordination (milestones/stakeholders) has API tests but no verified Kaneo UI",
		"SLA UI incomplete: no list/board/queue SLA badge (SLA-18), no paused explanation (SLA-13), no at-risk marker (SLA-19), nothing on the customer portal (SLA-21)",
		"scheduled_transition rows are written but no job executes them (WF-19); resolved-pause continuity is held (WF-17/18, SLA-9)",
		"Intake gaps: clarification-window auto-decline missing (IQ-15); queue lacks age and duplicate columns (IQ-5); no team-owned saved-view queues or full URL filters (IQ-19/20/21)",
		"Audit gaps: no audit-purge retention job (AU-6); reconstruction exists only in the domain package (AU-8/9); impersonation dual-identity flow is incomplete (AU-4)",
		"Calendar gaps: no country holiday presets (CAL-10/11) and no retroactive-holiday affected-count warning (CAL-13)",
		"No web authoring UI for versioned workflows (API only). P2 admin screens live in the separate /agent/settings frame, not the Kaneo dashboard settings shell. No raw button/input/select/textarea/dialog found on P2 surfaces (scripts/ci/check-ui.mjs --raw-elements)"
	],
	"tonight_actions": [
		"Add a domain-event outbox consumer job (separate from the notification outbox-drain) that claims unprocessed outbox rows and routes sla.at_risk/sla.breached/submission.replied through materializeNotificationFanout with resolvers; integration test in a dedicated DB (never the live browser DB)",
		"Implement a scheduled-transition executor job (every minute, leader-locked) that runs due scheduled_transition rows through transitionWorkItem as a system actor; tests/api/scheduler registration and integration tests",
		"Add a compact SLA badge (Badge + icon + remaining text) to work-item-kaneo-list/board card/triage rows from work_item_sla_cache; render pause reason/since and an at-risk marker in work-item-sla.tsx; extend work-item-sla.test.tsx",
		"Add instance_setting.clarification_window_days (migration, default 14) and an auto-decline branch in the 15-minute reminder-scan with customer-reopenable state; domain plus integration tests",
		"Add age and suggested-duplicate count columns to triage.tsx using the existing Table and duplicate endpoint; extend triage.test.tsx",
		"Add an audit-purge job (configurable retention, writes audit.purged with count, anchors the chain) and a GET work-item reconstruction endpoint over packages/domain/src/audit reconstruct",
		"Add the SLA escalation path: on sla.breached, walk project stakeholders by escalationOrder with escalationWaitMinutes (no-op when none); integration test",
		"Expose customer-safe SLA state/due time on portal submission/work-item detail (SLA-21) with an isolation test that no policy internals leak"
	]
